# /etc/default/prometheus-alertmanager — ARGS for prometheus-alertmanager.service.
# Mirrors prometheus.default: the listen address is set here (the .deb default ARGS="").
# Bind the tailnet IP only (no host firewall — binding 100.85.100.81 keeps :9093 off LAN
# 192.168.1.92, same rule as every other observability unit). The unit has no
# WorkingDirectory, so config/storage paths are given explicitly. --cluster.listen-address=
# (empty) disables the HA gossip listener — this is a single Alertmanager, not a cluster, so
# nothing should bind :9094. --web.external-url makes the "Silence"/source links in Slack
# notifications resolve back to this box.
ARGS="--config.file=/etc/prometheus/alertmanager.yml --storage.path=/var/lib/prometheus/alertmanager --web.listen-address=100.85.100.81:9093 --web.external-url=https://proximal.tail0ecc2e.ts.net:9493/ --cluster.listen-address="
